# .rules

## About This Project

`hermes-agent-acp` is an ACP v1 adapter for Hermes Agent (nousresearch/hermes-agent). Hermes ships its own ACP adapter (`hermes acp`, whose `hermes-acp` launcher its installer claims on PATH, hence this project's binary name), but it has several structural problems that remain open. This adapter instead builds on Hermes' `tui_gateway` (the JSON-RPC backend behind `hermes --tui` and `hermes serve`) and owns the full ACP v1 surface itself, the same architecture codex-acp uses over `codex app-server`.

Once Hermes Agent officially adopts a current ACP schema, this repo can be considered for deprecation.

- Runtime: TypeScript, ESM, Node. Entry point is `src/index.ts`; esbuild bundles to `dist/index.js`.
- Package manager: pnpm only (`pnpm install`, `pnpm run typecheck`, `pnpm run test`, `pnpm run build`), version pinned by `packageManager` in package.json. Do not use npm/yarn/bun unless a human explicitly asks.
- Protocol boundary: this process is an ACP agent over stdio on one side and a `tui_gateway` JSON-RPC client on the other. It owns no sessions or state of its own beyond what the ACP surface requires; Hermes owns sessions, tools, and model calls.

References:

- Reference repos and key files: docs/refs.md (Hermes source, codex-acp template, ACP v1 schema)
- Roadmap and feature status: docs/todos.md

